{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R01", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "退货期限", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 363, "source_excerpt_sha256": "44d340a2750636ca9b7a2268fa92fe1b1a930a6d345b6fe6c5375d54d3c66d8d", "source_start": 188, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "普通顾客退货期限为60天，宜家俱乐部会员为365天；同时须满足货品及凭证条件。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R02", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "退货材料和银行卡退款", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 363, "source_excerpt_sha256": "44d340a2750636ca9b7a2268fa92fe1b1a930a6d345b6fe6c5375d54d3c66d8d", "source_start": 188, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "退货需完好货品、原始购物凭证和已开具的发票；银行卡退款还需原始签购单和银行卡。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R03", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "不适用的商品", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 422, "source_excerpt_sha256": "67b9a153f39bbf4fa08b2715798fa6e09c957676003d55fb08070d8a4596bd62", "source_start": 364, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "食品、家用电器、购买前另签协议的特殊定制品，以及被切割、裁剪、油漆的产品不适用该退货政策。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R04", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "发票已入账抵扣", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 363, "source_excerpt_sha256": "44d340a2750636ca9b7a2268fa92fe1b1a930a6d345b6fe6c5375d54d3c66d8d", "source_start": 188, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "已开票且发票已入账或抵扣时，须先在电子税局完成红字信息确认单的确认流程，再办理退货。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R05", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "货品完好条件", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 574, "source_excerpt_sha256": "453ea8d46c52807ff85e77252e685b3829704d654bb3411227f52db1a657486e", "source_start": 484, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "完好货品须未受损、无污渍、未变形、未经洗涤、无使用痕迹等。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R06", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "退款处理时间", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 751, "source_excerpt_sha256": "b940371ef8c3710bd32e6a168847a7500cf220c0ebf56b0a5ea56acfa0661928", "source_start": 709, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "收到退货商品并确认无误后，宜家在7日内办理退款手续，按原始支付方式退回；不等同于付款机构即时到账。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R07", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "线上发票中心时间", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 889, "source_excerpt_sha256": "b21ac5a98b14dedc0099f1eec730a9c15eec9884b5d7e8b3966cdeefdece1832", "source_start": 822, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "线上购买的产品，发票中心工作日09:00至17:30处理，节假日与非工作日不处理发票。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R08", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "配送费用", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 1072, "source_excerpt_sha256": "3a05778ed02696fdcd5cd8ce961bd84feb3173030f58da88f3839e442f641ba4", "source_start": 1044, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "订单在送货当天或配送服务完成后取消，运费不予退还。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R09", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "混合付款退款", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 1121, "source_excerpt_sha256": "80ef22da67093efba789addff26657d2d085efa5f4ea6509c890f4a997581bb0", "source_start": 1084, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "购买时采用多种支付方式，退货退款按各种支付方式的比例退回。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R10", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "政策地域和渠道", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 472, "source_excerpt_sha256": "ccdeb756995127266df4d4e2a9332b2586e84bb24a8b4e0da6462c71c7b80189", "source_start": 423, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "适用范围为中国大陆宜家商场、宜家官网、官方APP和小程序及电商商城所购货品，不能直接套用到其他地区。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "R11", "document_id": "ikea_returns", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "线上退货方式", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/return-policy/", "source_end": 674, "source_excerpt_sha256": "8a1fd77ff403526794f4ce08929d826a1d265b73ff52f620a68dabb9f465e2fd", "source_start": 645, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_returns.txt", "text": "可选择有偿上门收货或自行邮寄至指定商场。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-51082fab8c38"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "G01", "document_id": "ikea_guarantees", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "质保开始和凭证", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/guarantee/", "source_end": 267, "source_excerpt_sha256": "78842ae35859ba86a2c4b94edb2b7af4b6dfa94bb591cc2e16279c515164455b", "source_start": 227, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_guarantees.txt", "text": "质保从购买之日起开始，索赔需提供原始购买凭证。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-de2aacf67629"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "G02", "document_id": "ikea_guarantees", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "床垫质保", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/guarantee/", "source_end": 378, "source_excerpt_sha256": "db3762b40176ae43f895bb8494af8ffefe5c1fca01d5c0d1302d55e328186522", "source_start": 303, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_guarantees.txt", "text": "床垫概览列出10年品质保证，涵盖材料和工艺；具体保障范围仍须核对完整条款，不代表任意损坏都承保。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-de2aacf67629"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "G03", "document_id": "ikea_guarantees", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "浴室系列与配件", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/guarantee/", "source_end": 974, "source_excerpt_sha256": "b021a3813663361632e16fea434823bd0d519c4de4e9ee2e3fb9b6b100f982af", "source_start": 800, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_guarantees.txt", "text": "页面列出的浴室系列享有10年免费质保，淋浴配件为3年；仅限页面列出范围，须核对完整条款。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-de2aacf67629"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "G04", "document_id": "ikea_guarantees", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "厨房系列质保区别", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/guarantee/", "source_end": 1396, "source_excerpt_sha256": "ce3d17c12361d072e56b4b06b37e502f81810d935bfea0061446ba2bccf512ec", "source_start": 1248, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_guarantees.txt", "text": "厨房系列METOD米多为25年、ENHET安纳特10年、KNOXHULT诺克胡5年品质保证，涵盖材料和工艺缺陷，具体范围见完整条款。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-de2aacf67629"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "G05", "document_id": "ikea_guarantees", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "厨房刀具与锅具", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/guarantee/", "source_end": 1593, "source_excerpt_sha256": "ac1d2fcba8a5e1325bfd4a3f7ccf31cd1fca994af64bf967aa68bf4cd07ae443", "source_start": 1486, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_guarantees.txt", "text": "厨房刀具可享15年品质保证；无不粘涂层的锅具为15年免费质保，各以完整条款范围为准。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-de2aacf67629"}
{"category": "all", "chunk_id": "G06", "document_id": "ikea_guarantees", "effective_from": null, "effective_until": null, "origin": "official", "scope": "ikea_cn", "section": "办公椅品质保证", "source": "https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/returns-claims/guarantee/", "source_end": 1802, "source_excerpt_sha256": "7ff32f637724ecff0a91f252b4de8eeafb06156960919e5d6dd18f45ed5883a4", "source_start": 1700, "source_text_path": "data/knowledge/e1_v1/sources/ikea_guarantees.txt", "text": "办公椅概览列出10年品质保证，涵盖活动部件、框架材料、工艺及功能瑕疵，以完整文档条款为准。", "version": "snapshot-2026-10-24-de2aacf67629"}
